# Go Blank makes Bot2 discard Titanbones, then exiles it before the trigger goes on the stack. The ability still gains
# life for Bot2, not Go Blank's controller, and survives the card's next zone change (CR 113.8/113.7a/608.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sol Ring
Go Blank
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Titanbones, Towering Heart
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Go Blank.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Titanbones, Towering Heart; Island)
? Bot2.Life = 20
? Stack = Titanbones, Towering Heart

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 23
Bot1.Graveyard = Go Blank
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Titanbones, Towering Heart; Island
